{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An online action RTS where the tide can turn in a flash!</h2><br>Fight exciting battles where you recruit golems to battle your opponent\u2019s slimes, cleverly redirect their slimes with walls, or sneakily steal their flag to make a dramatic comeback.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/extras/SteamGif001.gif?t=1741843130\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy to play, hard to master</h2>Unlike traditional RTS games, Jelly Troops doesn\u2019t have complex units or resource management, so anyone can pick it up and play. Every battle is different. Should you get more slimes, capture the flag, or send your guardians to punish your opponent? It\u2019s up to you!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/extras/SteamGif002.gif?t=1741843130\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An easy RTS that anyone can play<br></li><li>Fast-paced action<br></li><li>Sneaky capture-the-flag gameplay<br></li><li>Cute visuals and animations<br></li><li>Quick matches<br></li><li>Highly replayable<br></li><li>Play against your friends or match with random players anywhere in the world<br></li><li>Split-screen 2-player battles</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3084910?t=1741843130","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3084910?t=1741843130","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/be856933b828b25dc6406e3a57c966cd94b42623/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741843130","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/be856933b828b25dc6406e3a57c966cd94b42623/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741843130","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"desc